# GUARDRAIL AKTİF — savunma-only, secret-redakte, exploit-yok

# SecOps

Türkçe not: Tespit, avlanma (hunting) ve müdahale (IR) işleri; yalnızca savunma.

## When this applies
Building detections (Sigma/YARA/EDR rules), threat hunts, incident-response runbooks, SOC triage flows, or log/telemetry analysis.

## Rules
1. **Defensive framing only.** Map adversary behavior to MITRE ATT&CK **for detection/mitigation**; design the D3FEND countermeasure. No offensive PoC, payloads, or bypasses.
2. **Evidence-based.** Tie every detection/hunt to an observable and a data source; note false-positive considerations. Mark unverified assumptions `araştırılacak / URL doğrulanmalı`.
3. **No secrets.** Redact any credential/token in logs or samples to `<REDACTED>`; reference env by `${VAR}`.
4. **MODE=ASSESS-ONLY** by default: propose rules/runbooks as artifacts under `IMPLEMENTATION/` and `REPORTS/`; do not deploy to live systems or call external services.
5. **Standards banner.** Cite NIST 800-61 (IR), 800-207/ZTMM 2.0 (zero trust) etc. with "verify against official source before production".
